  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A horizontal force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> acts on a sphere. A horizontal resistive force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"kv^{2}\"></span> acts on the sphere where <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> is the speed of the sphere and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"k\"></span> is a constant. What is the terminal velocity of the sphere?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{F}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{k}{F}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F}{k}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{F}{k}}\"></span></li></ol>"
